# Docker builds that use the repository root as context (the NDR images: one codebase with the
# SIEM) see only what they copy. Everything else, above all the build output, stays out.
*
!ndr/rust/ndr-engine
!ndr/rust/siem-engine
!wazuh-rust-angular/backend-rust/crates/provigil-common
!wazuh-rust-angular/backend-rust/crates/auth-service
**/target
